OL,3,GNEWSA'Dream come true' as woman becomes
OL,4,Asteam train driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FBecoming the first female steam
OL,7,Flocomotive driver on the East
OL,8,FLancashire Railway (ELR) is "a dream
OL,9,Fcome true" for Steph Elwood.
OL,11,FElwood followed the traditional route
OL,12,Fthrough the steam department, from
OL,13,Fcleaner to fireman, and ultimately to
OL,14,Fqualified steam locomotive driver.
OL,16,FAfter completing the driving
OL,17,Fassessment, she hopes her success will
OL,18,Finspire other women to follow in her
OL,19,Ffootsteps.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
